# Annex A.1 - `getLambdaAndBy`

**Location:** inside `GaussianTwoFactors.m`, inside `methods`.

```matlab
function [lambda, By] = getLambdaAndBy(obj, strike, currMaturity, ulSwapSteps, x_state, args)
    % Returns:
    %
    %     lambda_i(x) = c_i * A(T0,Ti) * exp(-Bx(T0,Ti)*x)
    %
    % and:
    %
    %     By_i = B(b,T0,Ti)

    arguments
        obj (1,1) GaussianTwoFactors;
        strike (1,1) double;
        currMaturity (1,1) double;
        ulSwapSteps (1,:) double;
        x_state (1,1) double = 0;
        args.direction (1,:) char {mustBeMember(args.direction, {'PAY','REC'})} = 'PAY';
        args.notional (1,1) double = 1e6;
    end

    instr = obj.getSwaptionInstrument( ...
        strike, currMaturity, ulSwapSteps, ...
        'direction', args.direction, ...
        'notional', args.notional);

    basket = obj.getSwaptionBondBasket(currMaturity, ulSwapSteps);

    coeffs = instr.coeffs(:);
    A0Ti = basket.A0Ti(:);
    Bx0Ti = basket.Bx0Ti(:);
    By0Ti = basket.By0Ti(:);

    lambda = coeffs .* A0Ti .* exp(-Bx0Ti .* x_state);
    By = By0Ti;
end
```

